FRxRUliS2ViQ09MelVkVElyOVBmcEFKY1VadjhCeFZVUjJ6VzlfT3BrdzZfM0E?oc=5","date":"2026-10-23","zh":"Lyft 推出快速電話歸還服務，數小時內取回您的設備"},{"title":"San Francisco Officials Call on State Agency to Release Uber, Lyft Assault Data","src":"San Francisco Public Press","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxOREJBRVNKdmxOWWctdTVPQ3BTVUJST3FUTXA5QTVwT2pQLXFUaDJpaEVzVEpMZHlPRXN6bVI4YWhIcDU5YzRNcDdlTzEtQjgtSDNBR3hTcV93RzlrN3ozOHAwelpXaVdmbktGSGFUeEdET2ZVTXhBTzFJMlJmTE11UGo4M2VVOG1jc2tPdHR1aUJINmRXTVVnSnctOXprTHNVVU52R1QxREJNYmJLY1E?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"舊金山官員呼籲州立機構公佈 Uber、Lyft 攻擊數據"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":4},{"name":"減重藥/生技","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-11","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1759509/000162828026006960/lyft-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Lyft, Inc. (the \"Company\" or \"Lyft\") operates as a global mobility platform offering a mix of rideshare, taxis, private hire vehicles, executive chauffeur services, car sharing, bikes and scooters. Our established, scaled network of users is brought together by our robust technology platform (the \"Lyft Platform\") that powers rides and connections every day. Our Lyft mobile application (\"Lyft App\") connect riders with drivers for on-demand ride services and supports a variety of other multimodal solutions.","zh":"Lyft, Inc.（以下簡稱「本公司」或「Lyft」）作為一個全球行動平台運營，提供共乘、計程車、私人租賃車輛、行政司機服務、汽車共享、自行車和踏板車。我們強大的技術平台（「Lyft 平台」）匯集了我們已建立的規模化用戶網路，為每天的乘車和連接提供動力。我們的 Lyft 行動應用程式（「Lyft 應用程式」）將乘客與司機聯繫起來，提供按需乘車服務，並支援各種其他多式聯運解決方案。"},{"en":"Substantially all of our revenue is generated from our ridesharing marketplace that connects drivers and riders. We collect service fees and commissions from drivers for their use of our ridesharing marketplace. We also generate revenue from licensing and data access agreements, the sale of bikes and bike station software and hardware, advertising services, riders renting through our network of shared bikes and scooters, drivers renting vehicles through Express Drive and by making our ridesharing marketplace available to organizations through our Lyft Business offerings.","zh":"我們幾乎所有的收入都來自連結司機和乘客的共乘市場。我們向司機收取使用我們的共乘市場的服務費和佣金。我們還透過許可和數據存取協議、自行車和自行車站軟體和硬體的銷售、廣告服務、透過我們的共享自行車和踏板車網路租賃的騎士、透過 Express Drive 租賃車輛的司機以及透過我們的 Lyft Business 產品向組織提供我們的乘車共享市場來獲得收入。"},{"en":"In 2025, we expanded our operations beyond North America and strengthened our global footprint. We entered nine new countries and more than 180 cities through our acquisition of Intelligent Apps GmbH (d/b/a Freenow) in July 2025, a leading European multimodal app with taxi offering at its core. In October 2025, we acquired TheBookingRoomGroup Limited (d/b/a TBR Global Chauffeuring, or \"TBR\"), a global luxury chauffeuring company that operates in thousands of cities worldwide. As a result of these acquisitions, as well as additional expansion of our business, we now operate in thousands of cities across six continents. For additional information, see Note 4 \"Acquisitions\" included in Part II, Item 8, \"Financial Statements and Supplementary Data,\" of this Annual Report on Form 10-K.","zh":"2025 年，我們將業務擴展到北美以外，並加強了我們的全球足跡。 2025 年 7 月，我們收購了 Intelligence Apps GmbH（d/b/a Freenow），進入了 9 個新國家和 180 多個城市。 Intelligent Apps GmbH 是領先的歐洲多式聯運應用程序，以計程車服務為核心。 2025 年 10 月，我們收購了 TheBookingRoomGroup Limited（d/b/a TBR Global Chauffeuring，或稱「TBR」），這是一家在全球數千個城市開展業務的全球豪華司機公司。由於這些收購以及我們業務的進一步擴張，我們現在的業務遍及六大洲的數千個城市。如需了解更多資訊，請參閱本年度報告 10-K 表格第二部分第 8 項“財務報表和補充數據”中的附註 4“收購”。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"The market for Transportation-as-a-Service (\"TaaS\") networks is intensely competitive and characterized by rapid changes in technology, shifting levels of demand and frequent introductions of new services and offerings. We expect competition to continue, both from current competitors and new entrants in the market that may be well-established and enjoy greater resources or other strategic advantages.","zh":"運輸即服務（「TaaS」）網路市場競爭激烈，其特點是技術快速變化、需求水準變化以及頻繁推出新服務和產品。我們預期競爭將持續下去，無論是來自現有競爭對手還是市場新進者，這些新進業者可能已經成熟並享有更多資源或其他策略優勢。"},{"en":"Our main ridesharing competitor is Uber and our main competitors for app-based intermediation services for taxi and private hire vehicles are Uber and Bolt, though we also compete with other TNCs, taxi cab and livery companies as well as traditional automotive manufacturers and technology companies. Our main competitors in the bike and scooter sharing market include Lime, Bird, Fifteen, nextbike and Dott. We also compete with other manufacturers of bike and scooter sharing equipment for sales of such equipment, particularly in markets outside of the United States.","zh":"我們主要的共乘競爭對手是 Uber，我們在計程車和私家車應用程式中介服務的主要競爭對手是 Uber 和 Bolt，不過我們也與其他跨國公司、計程車和計程車公司以及傳統汽車製造商和科技公司競爭。我們在自行車和踏板車共享市場的主要競爭對手包括 Lime、Bird、Fifteen、nextbike 和 Dott。我們也與其他自行車和踏板車共享設備製造商競爭此類設備的銷售，特別是在美國以外的市場。"}],"segments":{"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":6060220000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":256041000,"zh":"非我們"}],"total":6316261000}},"peers":["UBER","PINS","ZM","BYND","SNAP"]}}